# Copy to .env and fill in real values for a deployed build. .env is gitignored; only this file
# belongs in Git.

# The API's own origin, e.g. https://icf-api.onrender.com/api. Leave unset in local development:
# Vite proxies /api and /health to the backend on localhost:3000 (see vite.config.ts), so the
# browser never leaves one origin and this variable is not needed.
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=
